menu "C5VRX receiver"

    config C5VRX_VIDEO_OUTPUT
        bool "Drive the 6-bit video DAC (GPIO 23, 24, 11, 12, 8, 9)"
        default y
        help
            Off: the transport (PARLIO TX, BitScrambler) runs unchanged, at the
            same timing, but its bits reach no pin. No picture, no menu on
            screen, no DAC test; the IQ capture (MODEM_DIAG -> PARLIO RX) and
            everything measured from it (C/N, gain, FIELD_DIAG) are unaffected.
            The six DAC pins become free (checkpoint audio).

endmenu
